"""KS2 English grammar, punctuation and spelling, Paper 1 (questions).

Per test: 18 grammar, 9 punctuation, 3 vocabulary, close to the STA 2016
framework profile for Paper 1 (grammar 25 to 35 marks, punctuation 10 to 20,
vocabulary 3 to 7, of 50). Skill names carry the framework reference (G1 word
classes ... G7 Standard English). Paper 2 (the spelling test, read aloud by
the teacher) is not modelled.
"""
from common import single, multi, matrix, cloze, highlight

